      "message": "fix(app): cut recipes cover the multi-axis deburr (main does not build)\n\nPR #3283 added OpParams::MultiAxisDeburr; PR #3399, merged right after\nfrom a review on an older main, added the exhaustive match in\nrecipe.rs::has_saved_geometry without it (E0004 on main). The multi-axis\ndeburr's exclude_edges are source picks like the 3-axis deburr's, so it\nshares that arm.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
